# Routine "Daily lead triage": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, scores the leads that came in overnight, merges duplicates, and lists what has no owner or is past its response window.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/leadsworth && pi -p "/daily-lead-triage"
